{"id":51697,"date":"2026-06-18T23:14:38","date_gmt":"2026-06-18T22:14:38","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/hybrid-day-ba11-beja\/"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:32:54","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:32:54","slug":"hybrid-day-ba11-beja","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/hybrid-day-ba11-beja\/","title":{"rendered":"Hybrid Day BA11 Beja 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Hybrid Day BA11 Beja 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A edi\u00e7\u00e3o de 2026 do <strong>Hybrid Day BA11 Beja<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>26 de setembro de 2026<\/strong> (S\u00e1bado), nas m\u00edticas e exclusivas instala\u00e7\u00f5es da <strong>Base A\u00e9rea N.\u00ba 11 (BA11)<\/strong>, em <strong>Beja<\/strong>. Organizada pela <strong>Hybrid Day League<\/strong> em parceria oficial com a <strong>For\u00e7a A\u00e9rea Portuguesa<\/strong> e cronometragem <strong>SincTime<\/strong>, a etapa integra a prestigiada <strong>Iberian League<\/strong> de fitness racing.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Num cen\u00e1rio militar \u00fanico entre aeronaves e pistas da base, a competi\u00e7\u00e3o desafia os atletas a completar <strong>8 blocos de 1.000m de corrida<\/strong> intercalados com <strong>8 exigentes esta\u00e7\u00f5es funcionais<\/strong> (SkiErg, Sled Push, Sled Pull, Burpee Broad Jumps, Row, Farmers Carry, Sandbag Lunges e Wall Balls), disputados em categorias individuais (Singles), duplas (Doubles) e estafetas (Relay).<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">26 de Setembro de 2026 \u00e0s 08:30<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px s